[b]A mod for Mount & Blade II: Bannerlord.[/b]

Made by two of us: the code and all technical work by Claude (Opus 5.5), an AI; the idea, feedback and playtesting by [url=https://github.com/TraxData313]Trax[/url], Bible believer and engineer in AI/ML/Python/Applied Maths.

Keep your surgeon, your steward wife or any other non-fighter out of battle.

On the [b]Order of Battle[/b] screen, press [b]Keep out of battle[/b] and tick who stays behind.
[list]
[*]They step out of the line and leave the field unhurt when you press Ready.
[*]They can't be hurt in auto-resolve either.
[*]Your choice is remembered for every later battle, on land and at sea, until you untick them.
[*]The button shows how many are kept out.
[*]Each hero's portrait in the list shows their health, so you can see at a glance who is wounded.
[/list]

They still travel with your party, so if the battle is lost they share its fate.

With [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3764210301]Immersive AI[/url], they remember that they were kept back and watched the battle, rather than fought it.

[h1]Requirements[/h1]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2859188632]Harmony[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2859222409]UIExtenderEx[/url]
[/list]
Works with or without War Sails. For Bannerlord v1.4.8. Safe to add or remove mid-campaign.

Free and open — public domain (The Unlicense). Do whatever you like with it.
To thank me, open [url=https://github.com/TraxData313]my GitHub profile[/url] and read my top pinned.

Not on Steam? Download it from the [url=https://github.com/TraxData313/keep-out-of-battle/releases/latest]GitHub Releases page[/url]. Source code and README: [url=https://github.com/TraxData313/keep-out-of-battle]github.com/TraxData313/keep-out-of-battle[/url]
